yG(a,b,c){return A.a0X("Connect with verified trek captains and local hosts.","Join group treks, coastal villas, and local meetups.","So we can keep bringing you the best experience and safety features, Aviaj is now app-only.","AVIAJ IS NOW APP-ONLY.",c,"Throw some Compliments their way so you stand out.",b,"Download Aviaj","Download on the","Aviaj Friends Forever helps you meet travel buddies, local friends, and group trek crews.","Explore AFF \u203a","Features designed to create space for real, respectful, and meaningful connections.","Explore Date \u203a","Real couples, solo group friendships, and seasonal dating guides across the world.","Explore Stories \u203a",new A.a0Y(),new A.a0Z(),"Aviaj is where travel connections actually start, whether you\u2019re looking for a lifelong relationship partner, a spontaneous vacation romance, or a verified travel co-pilot. Available in 190 countries with Destination Radar\u2122, Departure Prompts\u2122, and Crew Villas built for every kind of connection. Download free on iOS and Android.","CAREERS","DESTINATIONS","GET THE APP","LEGAL & PRIVACY","Advice and guides for building meaningful friendships.","GET IT ON","Get the\nAviaj app","Meet your next co-pilot.\nMake the next move.","Connect with verified solo & group travel buddies, vacation romance matches, and lifelong relationship partners on Aviaj.",new A.a1_(),new A.a10(),"Hide your profile from your boss, relatives, or exes.","Join Departure Circle",a,"Learn More","Discover real couples who met on Aviaj.","They complimented your photo","Oh wow! Where was this photo taken? Looks super familiar!","Naveen, 32","Marketing Manager","Indian University","Chats","Discover","Liked You","People","Profile","Safety","Sign in","Stories","Support","Read more","Safety features","The Aviaj Safety Center is here to guide you toward safe and meaningful connections.","Your safety comes first, always","Scan the QR\ncode to get the\nAviaj app","Plan the perfect date in every season.","Share your next itinerary","Help shape your next adventure by joining the Aviaj Departure Circle. Verified solo travellers share live routes, destination pins, and first-night plans before boarding.","Sign up","Put dating on hold with Snooze Mode.","Seen someone you like? Let them know.","Search for answers about your account, connections, features, and more.","How can we help?","Find your duty-free snack and match anywhere.","Get as close to IRL without leaving your house.")},
